I thought the same way at first, but there are a greater number of
monsters in nethack than the old hack.
All I know about Scrolls of Genocide follows:

a cursed scroll of genocide prompts you to type the name of a monster to
genocide, and then surrounds you with that monster.  Mean trick, eh?
This can be beneficial if you summon a monster that can help you, or if
you need an intrinsic really badly.

An uncursed genocide scroll prompts you to again type the name of a
monster to genocide, and that type of monster will vanish forever.  It is
for this reason I have a printout of the monster list next to my computer.

A blessed scroll of genocide prompts you for the LETTER you want to kill
off, which is very different from the name.  For instance, "d" will kill
all canines (puppies, dogs, jackels, wolves, etc.).  You can go for the
bonus dollars and even type something like "D" or "L" and make your game
much much easier.

As for the nurse trick, I've never tried it.  Hopefully somebody who knows
will reply because I'd like to know what the deal is myself.  They
supposedly heal you if you are naked/unarmed, but recent posts seem to
suggest you can raise your maximum hit points in this way...


